{"id":"d57b5a54109bb025","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-malcev-term.md","title":"Mal'cev Term","display":"df-malcev-term — Mal'cev Term","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-malcev-term","aliases":["93-df-malcev-term"],"display":"df-malcev-term — Mal'cev Term","depends_on":["[[93-df-variable]]","[[93-df-substitution]]","[[93-df-term]]","[[93-df-equation]]","[[93-df-equational-class]]","[[93-df-variety]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-malcev-term"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-malcev-term</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-malcev-term — Mal'cev Term"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"11b62d0ad578fa42\" href=\"?note=11b62d0ad578fa42\" title=\"93-df-variable\">93-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8e602c19b2984096\" href=\"?note=8e602c19b2984096\" title=\"93-df-substitution\">93-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca7404158049be33\" href=\"?note=ca7404158049be33\" title=\"93-df-term\">93-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1e2cbe43bd24f67f\" href=\"?note=1e2cbe43bd24f67f\" title=\"93-df-equation\">93-df-equation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"55094a403a51c25e\" href=\"?note=55094a403a51c25e\" title=\"93-df-equational-class\">93-df-equational-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" href=\"?note=f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" title=\"93-df-variety\">93-df-variety</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 是签名候选；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_n\">\\(v_n\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"11b62d0ad578fa42\" href=\"?note=11b62d0ad578fa42\" title=\"93-df-variable\">93-df-variable</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_3,x,y,z\">\\(X_3,x,y,z\\)</span> 在本文件固定为下述三个互异变量，不是 MalcevTerm₉₃ 的额外参数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,X_3}\">\\(\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,X_3}\\)</span> is the algebraic satisfaction relation of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"55094a403a51c25e\" href=\"?note=55094a403a51c25e\" title=\"93-df-equational-class\">93-df-equational-class</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}\\)</span> is the type-indexed variety predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" href=\"?note=f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" title=\"93-df-variety\">93-df-variety</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MalcevTerm}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{MalcevTerm}_{93}\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X_3\\coloneqq\\{v_0,v_1,v_2\\},\\qquad\nx\\coloneqq v_0,\\quad y\\coloneqq v_1,\\quad z\\coloneqq v_2\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X_3\\coloneqq\\{v_0,v_1,v_2\\},\\qquad\nx\\coloneqq v_0,\\quad y\\coloneqq v_1,\\quad z\\coloneqq v_2\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MS}_{93}^{xyy}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle v_0,v_0\\rangle,\\langle v_1,v_1\\rangle,\\langle v_2,v_1\\rangle\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{MS}_{93}^{xxy}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle v_0,v_0\\rangle,\\langle v_1,v_0\\rangle,\\langle v_2,v_1\\rangle\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MS}_{93}^{xyy}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle v_0,v_0\\rangle,\\langle v_1,v_1\\rangle,\\langle v_2,v_1\\rangle\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{MS}_{93}^{xxy}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle v_0,v_0\\rangle,\\langle v_1,v_0\\rangle,\\langle v_2,v_1\\rangle\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}malcev\\text{-}term}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MalcevTerm}_{93}(p,\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\land p\\in T_{\\tau}(X_3)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathbf A\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,X_3}\n\\langle\\widehat{\\operatorname{MS}_{93}^{xyy}}^{\\tau}(p),v_0\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10em}\\land\n\\mathbf A\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,X_3}\n\\langle\\widehat{\\operatorname{MS}_{93}^{xxy}}^{\\tau}(p),v_1\\rangle\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}malcev\\text{-}term}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MalcevTerm}_{93}(p,\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\land p\\in T_{\\tau}(X_3)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathbf A\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,X_3}\n\\langle\\widehat{\\operatorname{MS}_{93}^{xyy}}^{\\tau}(p),v_0\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{10em}\\land\n\\mathbf A\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,X_3}\n\\langle\\widehat{\\operatorname{MS}_{93}^{xxy}}^{\\tau}(p),v_1\\rangle\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both identities are required uniformly in the whole variety. Merely naming a ternary term does not make it a Mal'cev term.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[